WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.890
On a map, two towns are
eight centimetres apart.

2
00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:07.430
Is that a short stroll,
or a long day's walk?

3
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.890
Now look at a hill drawn on a map.

4
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.270
On one side, the lines are
squashed close together.

5
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.430
On the other side, they
are spread far apart.

6
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.090
Do the squashed lines mean that
side of the hill is higher?

7
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.870
In this mission, you'll use scale
to turn centimetres on a map

8
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.820
into metres and kilometres.

9
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:29.350
You'll read contour lines to
find the height and shape of the

10
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.130
land.

11
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:34.270
And you'll crack the code of
map symbols, using the key.

12
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:39.070
Your mission: work out distance,
height and slope from a map.
